NativeSvelte is forked from Native Shell (NSH), adapted and extended to provide
first-class native Svelte 5 ($state, $derived, $effect, $props) and SvelteKit
file-based routing (+layout.svelte, +page.svelte, client load()) support while
maintaining native platform views across iOS, Android, macOS, Windows, Linux,
GPUI, and the web.
